1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,060
Every Sunday, Juno and her fern have a standoff.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,340
She waters, she guesses, she hopes.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,900
The fern still sulks.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,662
Then she reads the Sprigly cap.

5
00:00:09,662 --> 00:00:11,044
One capful per litre.

6
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,140
Every two weeks, spring and summer.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,178
Standoff over.

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,338
Sprigly.

9
00:00:17,338 --> 00:00:19,073
One capful, no guessing.
